0003 — classlink.rs: trait constant binding (`zend_do_traits_constant_binding`,
`do_trait_constant_check`), deferred value compatibility for trait constants
and property defaults, properties of nested traits, direct trait constant
access, private final constructors (requires 0002).

 * Trait constants are bound after the class's own constants and enum
   cases. A trait constant meeting one of those (or an earlier trait's)
   must have the same visibility/finality, type and value, else "%s and %s
   define the same constant (%s) in the composition of %s. However, the
   definition differs and is considered incompatible. Class was composed"
   (first definer per find_first_constant_definition); meeting an enum
   case: "Cannot use trait %s, because %s::%s conflicts with enum case
   %s::%s". A trait constant overriding an inherited final constant:
   "%s::%s cannot override final constant %s::%s" (child named first).
   Previously trait constants were added before the own ones, so an own
   final constant equal to the trait's was reported against itself.
 * check_trait_property_or_constant_value_compatibility evaluates constant
   expressions; build_class has no VM, so values that need evaluating (for
   constants and for trait property defaults, which were assumed
   compatible) are returned in `LinkOut::value_checks` and compared with
   `is_identical` after evaluation in link_class (a failed evaluation counts
   as incompatible, as in php-src).
 * A trait's properties include those of the traits it uses
   (`trait_prop_decls`), e.g. a class using trait Indirect { use ATrait; }
   gets ATrait's (static) properties.
 * FETCH_CLASS_CONSTANT on a trait: Error "Cannot access trait constant
   %s::%s directly".
 * check_method_inheritance: a private parent method is skipped only if
   it is neither abstract nor the constructor (`(parent_flags &
   (PRIVATE|ABSTRACT|CTOR)) == PRIVATE`), so overriding a `final private
   __construct` is "Cannot override final method %s::__construct()".

Fixes Zend/tests/traits: bug55214, constant_004, constant_005,
constant_006, constant_007, constant_008, constant_009, constant_010,
constant_011, constant_012, constant_013, constant_014, constant_015
(13 tests). (traits/bugs/gh13177 additionally needs the duplicated
compile-time warning fixed in the compiler, see the report.)

